      "section_id": "SEC-1582CA30EF287D65",
      "section_path": [
        "9 电网调度",
        "9.3 有功功率调节",
        "9.3.1 远程有功调节",
        "9.3.1.2 闭环控制"
      ],
      "section_title": "9.3.1.2 闭环控制",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "例如，当设置查询恢复时间为“60”时，表示当逆变器收到功率调节指令后60 秒内，数据采集\n器不会采集逆变器的数据。在该段时间，由于常规的数据交互被暂停，运维人员通过Web 端\n或云平台查看设备的数据会出现滞后。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        101.736,
        72.906,
        466.578,
        110.859
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-FD4A804A3670A501",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 91,
      "printed_page_label": "81",
      "block_order": 2,
      "section_id": "SEC-1582CA30EF287D65",
      "section_path": [
        "9 电网调度",
        "9.3 有功功率调节",
        "9.3.1 远程有功调节",
        "9.3.1.2 闭环控制"
      ],
      "section_title": "9.3.1.2 闭环控制",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "步骤 3 在帧延时文本框内，指定数据采集器读取逆变器数据的帧时间间隔。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        70.866,
        114.984,
        371.736,
        127.467
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-A78E115D37834C66",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 91,
      "printed_page_label": "81",
      "block_order": 3,
      "section_id": "SEC-1582CA30EF287D65",
      "section_path": [
        "9 电网调度",
        "9.3 有功功率调节",
        "9.3.1 远程有功调节",
        "9.3.1.2 闭环控制"
      ],
      "section_title": "9.3.1.2 闭环控制",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "步骤 4 在目标值过滤下拉列表中，选择合适的目标值过滤方式。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        70.866,
        131.484,
        326.736,
        143.967
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-6A111C3EE344BAB3",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 91,
      "printed_page_label": "81",
      "block_order": 4,
      "section_id": "SEC-1582CA30EF287D65",
      "section_path": [
        "9 电网调度",
        "9.3 有功功率调节",
        "9.3.1 远程有功调节",
        "9.3.1.2 闭环控制"
      ],
      "section_title": "9.3.1.2 闭环控制",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "当功率调节的目标值发生较大或突然的变化时，逆变器如需要迅速调整其输出，可能会影响\n电网稳定。而设置目标值过滤方式，可以保证逆变器输出功率平稳，减少对电网的负面影\n响。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        101.736,
        149.406,
        461.736,
        187.359
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-09DEB205FD5ED7AB",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 91,
      "printed_page_label": "81",
      "block_order": 5,
      "section_id": "SEC-1582CA30EF287D65",
      "section_path": [
        "9 电网调度",
        "9.3 有功功率调节",
        "9.3.1 远程有功调节",
        "9.3.1.2 闭环控制"
      ],
      "section_title": "9.3.1.2 闭环控制",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n相同值：调度时，逆变器只响应首次功率调节指令设置的目标值。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        101.736,
        191.406,
        376.911,
        202.359
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-61114620FDEAD5D7",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 91,
      "printed_page_label": "81",
      "block_order": 6,
      "section_id": "SEC-1582CA30EF287D65",
      "section_path": [
        "9 电网调度",
        "9.3 有功功率调节",
        "9.3.1 远程有功调节",
        "9.3.1.2 闭环控制"
      ],
      "section_title": "9.3.1.2 闭环控制",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n变化率≤0.5%Pn：允许目标值在一定比例内变化。如果两次功率调节指令目标值的变化率\n在逆变器额定功率（Pn）的0.5%以内，逆变器无需调整输出。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        101.736,
        206.406,
        467.37,
        230.859
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-BEB71A51BDDA8AE2",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 91,
      "printed_page_label": "81",
      "block_order": 7,
      "section_id": "SEC-1582CA30EF287D65",
      "section_path": [
        "9 电网调度",
        "9.3 有功功率调节",
        "9.3.1 远程有功调节",
        "9.3.1.2 闭环控制"
      ],
      "section_title": "9.3.1.2 闭环控制",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n不过滤：逆变器会响应任何功率调节指令的目标值。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        101.736,
        234.906,
        322.911,
        245.859
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
